[Finta Documents](https://finta.ai/product/documents) can organize uploaded source files and make supported indexed formats available to Aurora.[Finta Share Pages](https://finta.ai/product/pages) can present approved materials through public, email-required, or email-verified access. Supported identified session activity can return to the relevant relationship context.


